8388c17abf05d9 3x"}, "body": "hello, i saw the last skeb you uploaded and i thought it was absolutely beautiful, i fell in love with your artstyle. please could you draw my character; i really liked the expression you drew in your first skeb. you have full freedom with the hairstyle, clothes, etc., as long as her base features are still there. i will attach both the version with wings and without wings, you can also choose whether to include them (or a version with and a version without would also be happy if you choose to draw them). i would love to see her mascot as well, if it is possible, but i understand if not. thank you very much for considering my request.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1TNsq1BKnW6tkP9vYkpVLY1YG4Wx2MqCl/view?usp=sharing\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/16LjjOY6KIp-R2WbMNQWX3K-99XBz_18o/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@oyu_wish/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3775143, "client_id": 2662161, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8ab3101/uploads/origins/b498f54d-5140-4085-a839-767ec5556d3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2503d4414ff8cd68cf119bcac8943ef2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8ab3101/uploads/origins/b498f54d-5140-4085-a839-767ec5556d3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2503d4414ff8cd68cf119bcac8943ef2, https://si.imgix.net/f8ab3101/uploads/origins/b498f54d-5140-4085-a839-767ec5556d3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b67c3eacc4c1f5ed1df3ea1360e6fe07 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8ab3101/uploads/origins/b498f54d-5140-4085-a839-767ec5556d3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c31e32acec38eacb549715a42fdaa68f 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "conso